  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "キャプテンたちから　もらった\nはなびらを　ひとつに　まとめたもの。\nせいちょうを　みとめられた　あかし。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "캡틴들에게 받은\n꽃잎을 하나로 만든 것.\n성장을 인정받은 증표.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "以從隊長們那裡得到的花瓣\n構成的一朵花。這朵花\n證明了他們認同你的成長。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une fleur formée à partir des pétales que vous ont\nremis les sept Capitaines. C’est le symbole de\nce que vous avez accompli jusqu’ici.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diese Blüte besteht aus den Blütenblättern, die du\nvon den Captains erhalten hast. Sie ist ein Symbol\nder Anerkennung deiner Stärke.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Flor resultante de la unión de los siete pétalos\nentregados por los Capitanes, símbolo de la\nexperiencia y madurez acumuladas en tu aventura.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Fiore composto dai petali ottenuti dai Capitani.\nÈ la prova che i tuoi progressi sono stati\nriconosciuti.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A flower made of the petals you received from\ncaptains. It’s proof that your growth has been\nrecognized by them.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "キャプテンたちから　もらった\nはなびらを　ひとつに　まとめたもの。\n成長を　認められた　証。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "将得自队长们那里的花瓣\n化零为整后形成的东西。\n是成长得到认可的证明。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Flor resultante de la unión de los siete pétalos\nentregados por los Capitanes, símbolo de la\nexperiencia y madurez acumuladas en tu aventura.",
      "version_group": {
